      "sha": "f7df40db5fb429e10ef0a8bdc19e150bd6c2bd72",
      "message": "fix(cli): pass budget.toml lint levels via DYLINT_RUSTFLAGS\n\nTrailing args to `cargo dylint` are forwarded to `cargo check`, which\nrejects lint-level flags, so any project with a budget.toml failed with\n\"unexpected argument '-W' found\" before linting even started. Route the\nlevels through DYLINT_RUSTFLAGS (appending to any existing value) so\nthey reach rustc.\n\nVerified end to end against a soroban-sdk contract: with\nsoroban_storage_in_loop = \"deny\", a storage write inside a loop now\nfails the build with exit code 1, and the fixed contract passes.",
      "isVerified": false,
      "authoredAt": "2026-07-14T07:41:44Z"
    }
